# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill it in. .dev.vars is git-ignored, so the key never lands in the repo.
# Get a key from the Anthropic Console (https://console.anthropic.com). Set a monthly spend limit there too.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Default is claude-opus-5. claude-haiku-4-5 costs about a fifth as much per token.
# MODEL=claude-opus-5

# Optional. low | medium | high. Default is low. Ignored on Haiku.
# EFFORT=low
